Package: fcitx5-projectkey-data
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Dictionary and context models for Project Key
 The McBopomofo dictionary and the trained sentence models. They change far
 less often than the program, so they are a package of their own, versioned
 by the models' date.
